# What the image build is allowed to see.
#
# Two reasons to keep this tight: speed (the context is sent to the daemon on
# every build) and safety (nothing secret or device-specific may ever reach a
# layer). `firmware/` is excluded whole, which also excludes `firmware/wifi.env`
# - the image builds host crates only and never needs WiFi credentials - and
# `backup/` is excluded because it holds the Tidbyt's stock flash image.

# Build outputs: the container builds its own, in its own cache mount.
target/
firmware/target/
lab/target/
lab/xtensa-bench/target/

# Never in an image, never in a build context.
backup/
firmware/
**/wifi.env
.env
*.env

# Not needed to build or run the studio.
.git/
.gitignore
.github/
.claude/
captures/
docs/
lab/
README.md
CLAUDE.md
tools/
Dockerfile
.dockerignore
docker-compose*.yml

# Editor and OS litter.
.DS_Store
*.swp
